		{"id":"long-generation","type":"file","file":"Growth Space/Projects/Software/ML/wan-dit-lab/docs/research/mvp1/Long-generation.md","x":-1920,"y":-180,"width":1780,"height":3173},
		{"id":"model-history","type":"file","file":"Growth Space/Projects/Software/ML/wan-dit-lab/docs/research/mvp1/Model.md","subpath":"#Before choosing LongLive","x":-3920,"y":520,"width":1780,"height":827},
		{"id":"model-notation-text","type":"text","text":"<span class=\"wan-scene-style wan-scene-math wan-scene-grid\"></span>\n\nConsider video generation from a prompt. We split the latent video into chunks.\n\n$$\n\\underbrace{\\mathrm{ctx}}_{\\text{prompt vectors}},\\quad\n\\underbrace{\\mathrm{lat}_n}_{\\text{finished chunk}},\\quad\n\\underbrace{n=0,\\ldots,N-1}_{\\text{chunk index}},\\quad\n\\underbrace{\\epsilon_{n+1}}_{\\text{new noise}}.\n$$\n$$\n\\underbrace{W_m}_{\\text{weights of the chosen model}},\\quad\n\\underbrace{\\Phi_m}_{\\text{its generation rule}},\\quad\nm\\in\\{\\mathrm{Wan},\\underbrace{\\mathrm{SF}}_{\\mathrm{Self\\mbox{-}Forcing}},\\underbrace{\\mathrm{LL}}_{\\mathrm{LongLive}}\\}.\n$$\n$$\n\\underbrace{\\mathrm{KVvid}_n=(K_n,V_n)}_{\\text{memory of finished chunks}},\\quad\n\\underbrace{\\oplus}_{\\text{concatenation of K and V rows}},\\quad\n\\underbrace{F_{\\rm chunk},F_{\\rm anch},F_{\\rm win}}_{\\text{latent frames: chunk, anchor, window}}.\n$$\n\nNow consider what the model generates in one call and on what context it was trained.\n","x":-3920,"y":-180,"width":1780,"height":458},
		{"id":"model-text-decoder","type":"file","file":"Growth Space/Projects/Software/ML/wan-dit-lab/docs/research/mvp1/Model.md","subpath":"#Text and decoder","x":-3920,"y":1410,"width":1780,"height":830},
		{"id":"model-after-longlive","type":"file","file":"Growth Space/Projects/Software/ML/wan-dit-lab/docs/research/mvp1/Model.md","subpath":"#After choosing LongLive","x":-3920,"y":3289,"width":1780,"height":863},
		{"id":"longlive-boundary","type":"text","text":"---\n\n**LongLive choice · next stage**","x":-6000,"y":3109,"width":13560,"height":100},
